One tactic that I didn't see describe in the hack hints is the run away
from a monster by running around a second non-damaging (sleeping,
non-attacking, et.al.) monster trick.  This comes from running around
R's in rogue to regain hit points.  It is quite effective in hack with
one's dog, and can help Ts or Ss survive to the big time.

E.G.
	...	.@.	.H.	...	...	...
	.d@	.dH	@d.	Hd.	.d@	.d.
	.H.	...	...	.@.	.).	.@.

	fluff	fluff	fluff	fluff	fluff	you pick up a
	hits	misses	hits	hits	destoys	two-handed
	H	H	H	H	H	sword!

May you find the amulet!

